# Fetched or derived binaries, not source. Everything needed to rebuild them
# is in scripts/ plus the kernel_opt_log entry:
#   data/ckpt_*.pt   snapshots of experiments/fastdepth_train/artifacts/*.pt
#   data/calib32.npz the 32-frame calibration bank from the training box
#   data/nyu_val_*.npz  654 NYU val frames, preprocessed by scripts/ per the
#                    eval protocol (square centre crop -> 224 -> ImageNet norm)
#   data/nyu_h5/     40 raw NYU val HDF5 frames, for exercising the
#                    nyu_depth loader's h5 branch
#   ir/              extracted int8 IRs (regenerate with extract_fd_int8.py)
#   results/pred_*   dumped depth predictions (~130 MB each)
data/*.npz
data/*.pt
data/nyu_h5/
results/pred_*.npz
ir/
